{
  "id": "kotohira",
  "name": "Kotohira",
  "title": "金刀比羅",
  "description": "A long stone stairway climbing through cedars to a vermilion gate, stone lanterns glowing on both sides, mist drifting between the trunks and maple leaves falling. The light follows your clock.",
